   the stated scope, non-transferable, and revocable if You breach this
   license. Without verifiable proof, no permission exists.

6. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
   This license covers only the Owner's original work. Components owned
   by others (for example Nao-MD, Baileys, MessageBuilder, Starseal,
   community scrapers, and npm dependencies) remain under their own
